{"id":"76dde059f166d3e6","group":"58","path":"58/batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md","title":"Forcing Extension","display":"df-generic-extension — Forcing Extension","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-generic-extension","aliases":["58-df-generic-extension"],"display":"df-generic-extension — Forcing Extension","depends_on":["[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-generic-extension"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-generic-extension</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-generic-extension — Forcing Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d3f859dbdd37f018\" href=\"?note=d3f859dbdd37f018\" title=\"../batch02/58-df-poset.md\">../batch02/58-df-poset.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M,\\Gamma,G,P,N,x,\\tau\\in V\">\\(M,\\Gamma,G,P,N,x,\\tau\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\">\\(\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\)</span> (countable-transitive-model predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"66d43bb76d055059\" href=\"?note=66d43bb76d055059\" title=\"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md\">../batch06/58-df-ctm.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Generic}\">\\(\\mathrm{Generic}\\)</span> (generic-filter predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S\\)</span> (name-evaluation predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"0c40d420e5118724\" href=\"?note=0c40d420e5118724\" title=\"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md\">../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S\\subseteq V^5\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S\\subseteq V^5\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^4\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^4\\)</span> (precise predicate and compatibility projection defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma,P,G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)\\land N=\\{x\\in V:\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma,P,G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)\\land N=\\{x\\in V:\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma,P,G)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma,P,G)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The five-argument core retains the theory parameter required by the upstream CTM predicate; the four-argument form existentially projects only that parameter.</li>\n<li>When <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\">\\(\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\\)</span> holds, <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"N\">\\(N\\)</span> is conventionally denoted <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M[G]\">\\(M[G]\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^G\">\\(\\tau^G\\)</span> denotes the interpretation of the name <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau\">\\(\\tau\\)</span> by the filter <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span></li>\n<li>The extension consists exactly of the <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span>-values of forcing names belonging to <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span>.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"G\">\\(G\\)</span> is <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb{P}\">\\(\\mathbb{P}\\)</span>-generic over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"545853811ce0a4b6\" href=\"?note=545853811ce0a4b6\" title=\"../batch16/58-df-generic.md\">../batch16/58-df-generic.md</a>)</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch02/58-df-poset.md","status":"resolved","id":"d3f859dbdd37f018","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-df-poset.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch06/58-df-ctm.md","status":"resolved","id":"66d43bb76d055059","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)$ (countable-transitive-model predicate, see [[../batch06/58-df-ctm.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Generic}$ (generic-filter predicate, see [[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md","status":"resolved","id":"0c40d420e5118724","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S$ (name-evaluation predicate, see [[../batch05/58-df-name-evaluation.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch16/58-df-generic.md","status":"resolved","id":"545853811ce0a4b6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Remark]","excerpt":"$G$ is $\\mathbb{P}$-generic over $M$ (see [[../batch16/58-df-generic.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"M,\\Gamma,G,P,N,x,\\tau\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Generic}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S\\subseteq V^5","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S\\subseteq V^4","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension\\text{-}theory} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma,P,G)\\leftrightarrow\\mathrm{CTM}_S(M,\\Gamma)\\land\\mathrm{Generic}(G,P,M)\\land N=\\{x\\in V:\\exists\\tau\\in M\\;\\mathrm{NameEvaluation}_S(x,\\tau,G,P)\\}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}generic\\text{-}extension} \\vdash \\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)\\leftrightarrow\\exists\\Gamma\\in V\\;\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S(N,M,\\Gamma,P,G)","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GenericExtension}_S(N,M,P,G)","display":false},{"tex":"N","display":false},{"tex":"M[G]","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^G","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false},{"tex":"G","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbb{P}","display":false},{"tex":"M","display":false}],"bytes":1868,"backlinks":[{"id":"03c99436575af9c5","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"8eb8466c3c417107","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{GenericExtensionTheory}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (the theory-indexed forcing-extension predicate, see [[../batch13/58-df-generic-extension.md]])"},{"id":"15bc9a2ed3c9c46d","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a2335a033d2b39a0","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt"